    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I’ve always found mathematics useful, especially in physics and everyday problem-solving. As a self-employed person, I use basic math for budgeting and measurements. I didn’t study it deeply beyond upper secondary school, but I appreciate its logic and structure. It’s not my passion like philosophy, but it helps me stay grounded in practical life.",
